OL,3,GNEWSANew enforcement officers to be
OL,4,Arecruited for city
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew community safety enforcement
OL,7,Fofficers are being recruited to help
OL,8,Fensure Wolverhampton city centre
OL,9,F"remains a safe, welcoming and
OL,10,Fenjoyable place".
OL,12,FThe officers would carry out patrols,
OL,13,Fissue civil warnings where appropriate
OL,14,Fand "help ensure those who need support
OL,15,Fare directed to the appropriate
OL,16,Fservices".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
