OL,3,GNEWSANew enforcement officers to be
OL,4,Arecruited for city
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new officers would support
OL,7,Fenforcing the city centre's PSPOs,
OL,8,F"providing a visible presence and
OL,9,Fworking closely with businesses,
OL,10,Fresidents and partners to address
OL,11,Fanti-social behaviour".
OL,13,FThe city council said Public Spaces
OL,14,FProtection Orders [PSPOs], a legal aid
OL,15,Fgiven to councils to stop persistent
OL,16,Fanti-social behaviour, had given it
OL,17,Fmore powers to tackle the problem.
